#
# Build context for pkg/docker/Dockerfile, which does `COPY . .`.
# Keep out what the image build never reads: VCS metadata (and any
# credential a checkout left in .git/config), local build output, CI
# and editor configuration, and local secrets. Everything Cargo may
# read (sources, benches, examples, tests, docs, Cargo.lock) stays in.
.git
.github
.devcontainer
target
**/target
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.DS_Store
